  "history": {
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "Sixth Hair finishes refining a rank seven Immortal Gu after failing thirty-three times, taking heavy injuries twenty-seven times, and nearly dying nineteen times. He says that with this Immortal Gu he can help sect leader Fang Yuan. Within treasure yellow heaven, Fang Yuan’s will and He Feng Yang’s will complete a transaction under watch: Fang Yuan obtains an earth path resource point of Central Continent called nine central stone forest, while He Feng Yang obtains master-servant Gu. Observers take the public deal as approved by Heavenly Court pressure rather than Immortal Crane Sect acting alone.",
        "chapters": [
          2245
        ],
